WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Now that we've discussed how to stay calm and safe, let's see an assessment in action.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:09.000
On the screen is a video called Assessment Example.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:13.000
Let's watch this together and pay close attention to the rescuer's steps.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:16.000
We'll pause the presentation after to discuss it.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:19.000
I'm back now, love.

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:21.000
Did you go back to see that copper?

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:25.000
Marco!

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:29.000
Marco, what's happened? Wake up!

00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Marco, wake up!

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:32.000
What's happened?

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:45.000
Breathing.

00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:51.000
Ambulance.

00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:55.000
Yeah, my husband is not breathing.

00:00:56.000 --> 00:00:57.000
12 Park Street.

00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:01.000
Yeah, compressions, I can do compressions. Can you just hurry up, please?

00:01:03.000 --> 00:01:04.000
Okay.

